"shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","review_id":"Bk7FbO__3UtBPZDeeMNm1A","date":"2017-09-18T11:53:48","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9468120336532593,"text_excerpt":"Reginelli's is my favorite neighborhood pizza joint. There's usually ample parking in the median and there are a few spots on Harrison, but they're sometimes hard to snag. Once inside we're always seated right away, and my favorite spots are the booths on the raised level. The pizzas are delicious - really tangy red sauce, but if you're looking for something healthy try the Eat Fit menu. The Chicken Garcia wrap is amazing. If you're not looking for healthy, try the garlic knots. They're sinful!! If you go that route just know that it's not a first date appetizer. Seriously, the amount of garlic is enough to kill Nosferatu. But they're so worth it! I can't neglect to mention the soups. I l..."},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","review_id":"by8GQeEV66cRHYIOBqPWXg","date":"2011-09-24T23:10:00","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9389726519584656,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite place to get pizza and salad delivered to my home. We usually get the Chicken salad which has Gorgonzola and green apples, totally YUM!! The Tony's Play pizza with assorted pork and capers is a favorite too. Last week we actually went in for lunch because I had a groupon which was 'dine in only'. This place is SO cute!! I love the decor and the design, very well done. Our server was very sweet and attentive. The bathrooms were nice and clean. Now that I know about the pitcher deals on Monday and Tuesday I will have to work that into a date night somehow!"},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","review_id":"wl6-JDi91gRt-ulVIAd5YQ","date":"2016-03-03T13:02:23","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9388464689254761,"text_excerpt":"I'm very particular about my pizza and it took quite a few visits to Reginelli's before I admitted to myself that this place was pretty darned good. We rarely try any of the appetizers when we eat here, but the wifey is a big fan of hummus, therefore, we get the \"dressed\" hummus a lot, as it adds little extras like feta cheese, sun dried tomatoes, roasted red peppers & Calamata olives. The Caprese salad is also one of the better offerings I have had, and the sliced cucumbers are a nice treat that most other places do not add. If you are not in the mood for a pizza, there are several salad and sandwich options. The chicken salad is my favorite salad as it is loaded with warm chicken (I hat..."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","photo_id":"Cz3zE8nREG9jbVc9yfzO7g","label":"drink","image_url":"/photos/Cz3zE8nREG9jbVc9yfzO7g.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8697130680084229},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","photo_id":"dYR_Numlfu7EXngtKvKRnQ","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/dYR_Numlfu7EXngtKvKRnQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.840366005897522},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","photo_id":"vQ8k3ElYyVOAyYPubMHqKw","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/vQ8k3ElYyVOAyYPubMHqKw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8139464855194092},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","photo_id":"MEmMhyLsiMpBc9yjB85Iig","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/MEmMhyLsiMpBc9yjB85Iig.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7788143157958984},{"business_id":"X7W01ESZV0UybJ859ZnWRQ","photo_id":"rpED6iVv9piBsNqsfANDhg","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/rpED6iVv9piBsNqsfANDhg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7311168909072876}]},"notebook_case":null}
